    "High-vol median = 2 trading days. 89% of high-vol episodes are <=21 days, entirely missed by monthly rebalancing.",
    "Low-vol median = 3 trading days. Low-vol spells are persistent, allowing investors to maintain positions.",
    "After high-vol: P(->normal)=100.0%, P(->low)=0.0%. VIX descends gradually.",
